{"seq":2,"slug":"radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium","title":"放射性研究与镭的发现","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/paris-and-discovery/radioactivity-and-the-discovery-of-radium","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"放射性研究与镭的发现\">放射性研究与镭的发现</h1><p>1896 年，亨利·贝克勒尔偶然发现铀盐能自发放出一种穿透性射线。这一现象当时并未引起科学界足够重视，玛丽却敏锐地意识到其中蕴含着全新的物理。她以此为博士课题，与皮埃尔一道，把这股神秘的&quot;铀射线&quot;发展成一门崭新的科学——放射性研究。</p>\n<p>本篇从<strong>生平脉络</strong>讲述 1896—1902 年这段研究如何展开、对居里夫妇的生活意味着什么；其<strong>科学内涵</strong>（放射性概念、新元素、原子量测定）由兄弟 hub 系统展开，本篇不重复推导，只在关键处链接：<a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/the-concept-of-radioactivity\">放射性的概念</a>、<a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/polonium-radium-and-new-elements\">钋、镭与新元素</a>、<a href=\"../../core-contributions/isolating-and-quantifying/isolation-and-atomic-weight\">分离与原子量测定</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>1896—1902 年这段研究可拆成环环相扣的三步：<strong>选题</strong>（把被冷落的&quot;铀射线&quot;选为博士课题，并判断射线只取决于铀或钍的含量）、<strong>推断</strong>（沥青铀矿的&quot;超额&quot;放射性指向未知新元素，据此发现钋与镭）、<strong>实证</strong>（用四年体力劳作把假说锤成可称量的 0.1 克氯化镭并测定原子量）。其方法论内核是&quot;以精确测量驱动发现&quot;；其代价则是棚屋中长期无防护接触放射性，成为她日后死于再生障碍性贫血的远因。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选题的赌注</strong>：当时无人确知&quot;铀射线&quot;是否值得一篇博士论文。</li>\n<li><strong>推断的依据</strong>：射线强度只与铀（或钍）含量成正比，与化学形态、温度、光照无关。</li>\n<li><strong>实证的手段</strong>：从数吨沥青铀矿渣中经成百上千次分级结晶，历经约四年。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一个被低估现象里的博士课题\">一个被低估现象里的博士课题</h2><p>1897 年，玛丽在生下长女伊蕾娜后不久，需为博士论文选题。她选择了贝克勒尔那个尚被冷落的&quot;铀射线&quot;——一个大胆的赌注：当时无人确知它是否值得一篇博士论文。她借助皮埃尔与其兄雅克发明的灵敏石英压电静电计精确测量射线强度，得出关键结论：射线强度只取决于样品中铀（或钍）的含量，与化学形态、温度、光照无关。</p>\n<p>这意味着射线源于<strong>原子内部</strong>，而非分子间化学反应——一个动摇当时&quot;原子不可分&quot;信条的判断。她为这一性质创造了&quot;放射性&quot;（radioactivité）一词。这一概念的物理意义与历史定位，详见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/the-concept-of-radioactivity\">放射性的概念</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"沥青铀矿的反常与新元素的追寻\">沥青铀矿的反常与新元素的追寻</h2><p>在系统普查含铀矿物时，玛丽发现沥青铀矿（pitchblende）的放射性远强于其纯铀含量所能解释的程度。她大胆推断：矿石中必含尚未被发现、放射性远强于铀的新元素。皮埃尔被妻子的判断说服，暂时搁置自己的晶体研究，全力加入这场追寻——这是 <a href=\"sorbonne-years-and-pierre\">索邦求学与皮埃尔·居里</a> 中那段科研伙伴关系的第一次重大共同投入。</p>\n<p>1898 年，居里夫妇先后宣布发现两种新元素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>命名</th>\n<th>命名缘由</th>\n<th>公布时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钋（Po）</td>\n<td>polonium</td>\n<td>纪念仍处列强瓜分下的祖国波兰</td>\n<td>1898 年 7 月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镭（Ra）</td>\n<td>radium（拉丁语&quot;射线&quot;）</td>\n<td>因其放射性极强</td>\n<td>1898 年 12 月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;钋&quot;的命名是一次政治宣示——把华沙童年（见 <a href=\"../poland-and-awakening/warsaw-childhood-under-russian-rule\">沙俄统治下的华沙童年</a>）中被压制的民族认同，刻进了元素周期表。新元素的化学证认细节见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/polonium-radium-and-new-elements\">钋、镭与新元素</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"衰变定律-为何镭能持续发光\">衰变定律：为何镭能持续发光</h2><p>放射性的核心规律是活度随时间指数衰减。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为剩余原子核数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为衰变常数，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>N</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN}{dt} = -\\lambda N \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; N(t) = N_0 e^{-\\lambda t}, \\qquad A(t) = \\lambda N(t) = A_0 e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0491em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>半衰期为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>0.693</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1/2} = \\frac{\\ln 2}{\\lambda} \\approx \\frac{0.693}{\\lambda}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9703em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.693</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>镭-226 的半衰期约 1600 年，故能在人的一生尺度上&quot;取之不竭&quot;地放射，这正是它当年被视为奇迹物质的原因（也是它危险的根源，见 <a href=\"../../controversies-and-appraisal/science-safety-and-myth/radiation-dangers-and-her-death\">辐射危险与她的死亡</a>）。需注意：衰变定律的严格形式由卢瑟福与索迪在 1902—1903 年才确立，居里夫妇此时尚未掌握完整理论，他们的贡献是<strong>实证地确立放射性的存在与可测量性</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"棚屋里的四年-从理论判断到一克实证\">棚屋里的四年：从理论判断到一克实证</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title 放射性研究关键节点&#10;    1896 : 贝克勒尔发现铀射线&#10;    1897 : 玛丽选其为博士课题;长女伊蕾娜出生&#10;    1898 : 提出&quot;放射性&quot;概念;发现钋与镭&#10;    1898-1902 : 棚屋中处理数吨矿渣,反复结晶提纯&#10;    1902 : 提炼出约 0.1 克氯化镭,测定镭原子量&#10;    1903 : 玛丽通过博士论文答辩;同年获诺贝尔物理学奖\">timeline\n    title 放射性研究关键节点\n    1896 : 贝克勒尔发现铀射线\n    1897 : 玛丽选其为博士课题;长女伊蕾娜出生\n    1898 : 提出\"放射性\"概念;发现钋与镭\n    1898-1902 : 棚屋中处理数吨矿渣,反复结晶提纯\n    1902 : 提炼出约 0.1 克氯化镭,测定镭原子量\n    1903 : 玛丽通过博士论文答辩;同年获诺贝尔物理学奖</pre><p>为把理论判断变成可称量的实证，居里夫妇必须从数吨沥青铀矿渣中分离出纯镭。他们的&quot;实验室&quot;不过是一间四面透风、夏热冬寒的废弃棚屋；玛丽亲自搅拌沸腾的矿浆，进行成百上千次分级结晶。历经约四年，她于 1902 年提炼出约 0.1 克氯化镭并测定其原子量（约 225–226）。提纯与原子量测定的方法细节见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/isolating-and-quantifying/isolation-and-atomic-weight\">分离与原子量测定</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"反模式与原创综合\">反模式与原创综合</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>反模式（&quot;幸运发现&quot;叙事）</strong>：把镭的发现归于偶然，掩盖了真正稀缺的能力——在一个被忽视的现象里识别出根本性问题，并以四年体力劳作把假说锤成铁证。</li>\n<li><strong>更准确的看法</strong>：居里夫妇的方法论贡献甚至大于具体元素本身——他们确立了&quot;以精确测量驱动发现&quot;的范式（见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/measurement-first-method/precision-and-quantification\">精确与定量</a>）。同时也要诚实记录代价：棚屋中长期无防护接触放射性，是玛丽日后死于再生障碍性贫血的远因（见 <a href=\"../fame-and-later-years/world-war-and-final-years\">第一次世界大战与最后岁月</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一克镭带来的荣誉与悲剧，由 <a href=\"../fame-and-later-years/two-nobel-prizes-and-pierres-death\">两次诺贝尔奖与皮埃尔之死</a> 接续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>玛丽把被冷落的&quot;铀射线&quot;选为博士课题，用石英压电静电计得出&quot;强度只取决于元素含量&quot;的关键结论。</li>\n<li>沥青铀矿的&quot;超额&quot;放射性，使居里夫妇于 1898 年先后宣布发现钋与镭；&quot;钋&quot;的命名是一次政治宣示。</li>\n<li>衰变定律的严格形式由卢瑟福与索迪在 1902—1903 年才确立，居里夫妇的贡献是实证地确立放射性的存在与可测量性。</li>\n<li>棚屋四年锤炼出的 0.1 克氯化镭，把理论判断变成了可称量的铁证。</li>\n<li>同样四年的无防护接触，是她日后健康恶化的远因——恩物与毒物源出同一物质。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>信源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Curie\">Wikipedia: Marie Curie</a>、<a href=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/physics/1903/marie-curie/facts/\">Nobel Prize: Marie Curie</a>、<a href=\"https://www.britannica.com/biography/Marie-Curie\">Britannica: Marie Curie</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"放射性研究与镭的发现","id":"放射性研究与镭的发现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一个被低估现象里的博士课题","id":"一个被低估现象里的博士课题"},{"level":2,"text":"沥青铀矿的反常与新元素的追寻","id":"沥青铀矿的反常与新元素的追寻"},{"level":2,"text":"衰变定律：为何镭能持续发光","id":"衰变定律-为何镭能持续发光"},{"level":2,"text":"棚屋里的四年：从理论判断到一克实证","id":"棚屋里的四年-从理论判断到一克实证"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式与原创综合","id":"反模式与原创综合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索邦求学与皮埃尔·居里","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/paris-and-discovery/sorbonne-years-and-pierre"},"next":{"title":"两次诺贝尔奖与皮埃尔之死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/life-and-times/fame-and-later-years/two-nobel-prizes-and-pierres-death"}}